The data is invented
Every row was generated by the maintainers' scripts. Nothing comes from Best Practice's sample
databases, or from any real practice, patient or practitioner.

Third-party design
So that MedUI can be shown without a Best Practice installation, the databases are laid out as
MedUI's queries expect, which follows the design of Best Practice (Bp Premier). They hold only the
tables and columns those queries read, which the queries name already. Best Practice, Bp Premier and
their database design belong to Best Practice Software. This project is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Best Practice Software, and the licences above grant nothing in their product.

